    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102297" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τᾰνᾰός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ός</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Il.
			16.589
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			E.
			<u>Ba.</u>
			831
		</span></i>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τείνω</span>: prop. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταναϝός</span>, cf. sq.):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>outstretched, tall, taper</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰγανέη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
				</span></i>
			 l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστάχυες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Cer.</u>
					454
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῦρ . . , ὅσον -ώτερον ἦεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Emp.
					84.11
				</span></i>
			, cf. ib.<i><span class="en">
				5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλόκαμος τ</span>. <i>long
				flowing</i> locks, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				455
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				831
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. αἰθήρ</span>
			<i>outspread</i> ether, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Or.</u>
				322
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Sam.</u>
				111
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀήρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					1.681
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. γῆρας</span>
			<i>long</i> old age, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.281
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				11.389
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Lucill.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρνις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>C.</u>
					1.51
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταναῇ ὀπί</span> with
			<i>loud</i> voice, <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				12.58
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. χείλεα</span>, of a gadfly,
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				11.209
			</span></i>.</div>
